1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Helios — let your capital trade itself.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:14,000
An autonomous, self-custody trading agent
on BNB Chain. You choose what it optimizes for.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:22,000
It's built to survive markets,
not just predict them.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Deterministic decisions — not an LLM gambling.
+8.4% in backtests while the market fell 22%.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Powered by CoinMarketCap, Trust Wallet, and BNB Chain.
Your agent. Your rules. On-chain.

6
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Every trade is cleared by an isolated risk engine —
drawdown breaker, exposure caps, slippage, kill-switch.

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Self-custody: connect your own wallet.
Keys never leave you; funds can only return to you.

8
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Set your risk rules with simple sliders —
exposure, drawdown stop, trade size, cooldown.

9
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Fund the agent wallet, then launch.
Withdraw anytime.

10
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:28,000
A live dashboard — price candles, equity curve,
positions, and every decision in real time.

11
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Now watch it run live on mainnet.

12
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:47,000
It reads CoinMarketCap and ranks
every token by conviction.

13
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:54,000
It buys only the strongest signal — UNI —
approved by the risk engine.

14
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:00,000
The swap is signed from your wallet
and confirmed on BNB Chain.

15
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:06,000
The decision and risk policy are written
on-chain to an ERC-8004 identity.

16
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:13,000
Don't trust it — verify it on BscScan.
Deterministic. Self-custody. Proven on-chain.
